  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (S19-009-006 Rev P2, S19-009-002 Rev P2, S19-009-001 Rev P2, Drainage Statement dated 11th September 2020 ref S19-009 Rev 02, Construction Method Statement - Elite Pitches dates 11th September 2020 ref S19-009 Rev 03, Construction Traffic Management Plan, Surface Water Drainage Strategy - Pitches Planning Application dated 11 September 2020 QPRH-BHE-XX-XX-RP-0001 Rev P01, S19-009-010 Rev P2, S19-009-005 Rev P2, S19-009-004 Rev P1, Design & Access Statement - Elite Pitches dated 11th September 2020 ref S19-009 Rev 02, S19-009-011 Rev P2, S19-009-003 Rev P2, S19-009-014 Rev P2, S19-009-009 Rev P2, S19-009-013 Rev P3, S19-009-0012 Rev P2, \r\nLBH Drainage Assessment Form, QPRH_BHE_XX_XX_DR_CI_4000 Rev P01, QPRH_BHE_XX_XX_DR_CI_3002 Rev P01, QPRH_BHE_XX_XX_DR_CI_3000 Rev P01, QPRH_BHE_XX_XX_DR_CI_3001 Rev P01, QPRH_BHE_XX_XX_DR_CI_4001 Rev P01, QPRH_BHE_XX_XX_DR_CI_4002 Rev P01, Infiltration & CBR Testing letter dated 13th October 2020 QPRH_BHE_XX_XX_RP_CI_0601 Appendix B; received 16/12/2020\r\nQPRH_BHE_XX_XX_DR_CI_3000 Rev P01, QPRH_BHE_XX_XX_DR_CI_3000 Rev P01; received 11/01/2020\r\nThames Water Pre Dev Capacity Letter dated 30 November 2020; received 16/02/2021\r\nQPRH_BHE_XX_XX_DR_CI_3300 Exceedance Flow Paths, Drainage Strategy dated 3 March 2021 QPRH_BHE_XX_XX_DR_CI_0601 P04; received 04/03/2021) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8:00am to 6:00pm on Mondays to Friday and 9:00am to 1:00pm on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 4 - Prior to occupation, the applicant must submit for review and approval by the Lead Local Flood Authority evidence that the drainage system has been built as per the final detailed drainage designs through the submission of photographs and copies of installation contracts, and written confirmation that the drainage features will be managed as per the detailed maintenance plan for the lifetime of the development.",
    "Condition : 5 - All removal of trees, hedgerows, shrubs, scrub or tall herbaceous vegetation shall be undertaken between September and February inclusive. If this is not possible then a suitably qualified ecologist shall check the areas concerned immediately prior to the clearance works to ensure that no nesting or nest-building birds are present. If any nesting birds are present then the vegetation shall not be removed until the fledglings have left the nest."
  ],
